ind":"announcement","title":"Spinful is part of the October Next Fest!","summary":"Hey everyone,If you've found us through Next Fest, welcome.Over a year ago we had a simple idea, what if a slot machine was your weapon in a roguelite?A lot of work, late nights, and countless runs later, that idea became Spinful.One thing we wanted to be upfront about: everything in this game was made by us. The code, art, design, balancing, and all the weird little interactions you'll discover along the way. No AI-generated art, no asset flips, just a small team building a game we genuinely wa","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T10:33:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114028377","verified_at":"2026-10-21T11:56:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4228600-1845383656389308","game_id":"steam-4228600","kind":"update","title":"Spinful Release Date and Demo Update. Achievements, Auto-spin and more!","summary":"Spinful release date announcement!Spinful will release on Steam November 19th 2026. We are excited to announce the release date and all things are on track for a mid-November release. Hopefully there isn't anything else too exciting happening on that day. Big Demo Update - Lots of small bug fixes, mostly visual issues with a few large bug fixes that could occur under rare circumstances. - Game balance updates for symbol combinate damage, weapon scaling, enemy health and economy improvements for ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-03T14:37:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656389308","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:20:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4228600-1840944183787598","game_id":"steam-4228600","kind":"announcement","title":"Spinful Demo Release","summary":"I am extremely proud to announce that the Spinful Demo has just gone live this week as part of the Ukrainian Games Festival! This demo version has the following features:7 Pixel-Crafted Levels - each with their own retro themed soundtracks4 Weapon Types - up to 5 different rarities of each weapon to unlock and discoverCharacter Customization - unlockable cosmetics, pets and aura effects for your characterBonus Events, Crystal Jackpots and Huge Spins!The Spinful Demo will run for the foreseeable ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-18T01:24:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183787598","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:20:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4228600":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:45:53Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:45:53Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4228600":"2026-10-26T11:45:53Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4228600":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:45:53Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:45:53Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:45:53Z"},"4576140":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:45:53Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:45:53Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:45:53Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4228600","app_id":4228600,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:30Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"0f1871c9dd821584b6faecd3aac1b5d193f9db89620c3cccb7e08e1a1be412ca","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"판타지 로그라이트 슬롯 빌더. 슬롯을 업그레이드하고 강화하여 자신만의 강력한 전투 머신으로 커스터마이징하세요!","p